X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Ready to see the world? This Summer Reading Challe
 nge will take you around the world as you explore a variety of art medium
 s\, including drawing\, book illustration\, painting\, photography\, scul
 pture\, ceramics\, textiles and fiber arts\, and dance!</p>
